## Validation Commands (Copy-Paste Ready)

### After Step 1 (Test Loading)
```bash
cd framework
node -e "const {loadConfig} = require('./dist/utils/config-loader'); console.log(loadConfig('../sdk-tests'))"
```

### After Step 2 (Producer)
```bash
cd sdk-tests
qvac-test run:producer --runId=test-producer
```

### After Step 3 (E2E)
```bash
# Terminal 1: mosquitto -v
# Terminal 2: cd sdk-tests && qvac-test run:producer --runId=e2e
# Terminal 3: cd sdk-tests && qvac-test run:consumer:desktop --runId=e2e
```

### After Step 5 (Building)
```bash
cd sdk-tests
qvac-test build:consumer:desktop --platform macos
node build/consumers/macos/consumer.js --runId=built-test
```

### After Step 10 (SDK Repo)
```bash
# In SDK repo
npx qvac-test build:consumer:desktop --platform macos
npx qvac-test run:producer --runId=sdk-test
```

